From: tanghui <tanghui20@huawei.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Feb 2022 16:07:12 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 0791/2065] [Huawei] sched: Adjust wakeup cpu range according
 CPU util dynamicly

Offering: HULK
hulk inclusion
category: feature
bugzilla: 186575

--------------------------------

Compare taskgroup 'util_avg' in perferred cpu with capacity preferred cpu,
dynamicly adjust cpu range for task wakeup process.

Signed-off-by: tanghui <tanghui20@huawei.com>
---
